# Mobile UX

- UI copy is Turkish-first.
- Primary tabs: HOME, MAÇLAR, TRİBÜN, OYNA, PROFİL. Do not replace this IA.
- Use `src/design` primitives (button, card, chip, tabs, badge, avatar, sheet, dialog, skeleton, toast, error/empty). Screens do not invent new colors or one-off buttons.
- Brand: red / black / white + neutrals. No gradient-heavy or cliché “generic football” chrome.
- Every screen: loading, empty, error, offline/poor connection. Permission state where relevant.
- Accessibility: contrast, hit targets, labels. Dynamic type should not clip essential actions.
- Do not request Always/background location on first launch. Presence is opt-in and contextual (`docs/MATCH-PRESENCE.md`).
- Optimistic UI is allowed for likes/comments display only — never for XP, attendance, or prediction settlement.
